      "code": "def build_agent(sandbox):\n    # Create two thin vertical columns for structural support\n    col_l = sandbox.add_beam(8.0, 2.0, 0.2, 0.4, angle=0, density=1.0)\n    col_r = sandbox.add_beam(12.0, 2.0, 0.2, 0.4, angle=0, density=1.0)\n    \n    # Connect columns to ground (y=0.0) to ensure stability\n    sandbox.add_joint(col_l, None, (8.0, 0.0), type='rigid')\n    sandbox.add_joint(col_r, None, (12.0, 0.0), type='rigid')\n    \n    # Create a horizontal roof beam to distribute impact forces\n    roof = sandbox.add_beam(10.0, 4.2, 3.0, 0.2, angle=0, density=1.0)\n    \n    # Connect roof to columns to form a stable frame\n    sandbox.add_joint(col_l, roof, (8.0, 4.0), type='rigid')\n    sandbox.add_joint(col_r, roof, (12.0, 4.0), type='rigid')\n    \n    return col_l\n\n\ndef agent_action(sandbox, agent_body, step_count):\n    pass",
